### ML API Test Requests
### Test with: REST Client extension in VS Code or use Postman

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api/v1

### ============================================
### 1. ML MODELS ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

### 1.1 List all ML models
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/models
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 1.2 Get model metrics (Model ID: 1 - Demand Prediction)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/models/1/metrics
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 1.3 Get model metrics (Model ID: 3 - Recommendation NN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/models/3/metrics
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 1.4 Trigger model training
POST {{baseUrl}}/ml/models/1/train
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "triggered_by": 1,
  "note": "Scheduled retraining on 2025-11-16"
}

###

### 1.5 Check ML service health
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/health
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 1.6 Get model status
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/models/status
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ============================================
### 2. PRODUCT RECOMMENDATIONS
### ============================================

### 2.1 Get recommendations for Product 1 (default limit=10)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/recommendations/sample?product_sk=1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2.2 Get recommendations for Product 2 with custom limit
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/recommendations/sample?product_sk=2&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2.3 Get recommendations for Product 5
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/recommendations/sample?product_sk=5&limit=3
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ============================================
### 3. PRICE PREDICTIONS
### ============================================

### 3.1 Get price predictions (Product 1, Platform 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/price-predictions/sample?product_sk=1&platform_sk=1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3.2 Get price predictions with custom start date
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/price-predictions/sample?product_sk=2&platform_sk=2&date=2025-11-16&limit=5
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3.3 Get price predictions (Product 3, Platform 1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/price-predictions/sample?product_sk=3&platform_sk=1
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 3.4 Get price predictions (Product 4, Platform 2)
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/price-predictions/sample?product_sk=4&platform_sk=2&limit=7
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ============================================
### 4. ML PREDICTIONS (Existing Endpoints)
### ============================================

### 4.1 Predict demand for a product
POST {{baseUrl}}/ml/predict/demand
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "avg_price": 250000.0,
  "min_price": 220000.0,
  "max_price": 280000.0,
  "total_review_count": 500,
  "day_of_week": 3,
  "month": 11,
  "year": 2025,
  "avg_rating": 4.5,
  "price_change_pct": 2.5,
  "price_volatility": 0.15,
  "review_ma7": 45.0,
  "review_ma30": 40.0
}

###

### 4.2 Batch demand predictions
POST {{baseUrl}}/ml/predict/batch-demand
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "product_id": 1,
    "avg_price": 250000.0,
    "min_price": 220000.0,
    "max_price": 280000.0,
    "total_review_count": 500,
    "day_of_week": 3,
    "month": 11,
    "year": 2025,
    "avg_rating": 4.5,
    "price_change_pct": 2.5,
    "price_volatility": 0.15,
    "review_ma7": 45.0,
    "review_ma30": 40.0
  },
  {
    "product_id": 2,
    "avg_price": 350000.0,
    "min_price": 320000.0,
    "max_price": 380000.0,
    "total_review_count": 800,
    "day_of_week": 3,
    "month": 11,
    "year": 2025,
    "avg_rating": 4.3,
    "price_change_pct": -1.5,
    "price_volatility": 0.20,
    "review_ma7": 65.0,
    "review_ma30": 62.0
  }
]

###

### 4.3 Get product recommendations
POST {{baseUrl}}/ml/predict/recommendation
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": 1,
  "num_recommendations": 5
}

###

### 4.4 Get ML metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/ml/metrics
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 4.5 Reload models
POST {{baseUrl}}/ml/reload-models
Content-Type: application/json

###

### ============================================
### NOTES
### ============================================
###
### Available Product SKs: 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7, 10, 11, 12, 14, 15, 16, 18
### Available Platform SKs: 1 (Tiki), 2 (Lazada)
###
### Model IDs and their types:
### - 1: demand_linear_v1.0 (demand_prediction)
### - 3: recommendation_nn_v1.0 (product_recommendation)
### - 4: recommendation_kmeans_v1.0 (product_recommendation)
### - 6: customer_segmentation_v1.0 (customer_segmentation)
###
### Expected Response Formats:
###
### GET /ml/models returns:
### {
###   "total_models": 4,
###   "models": [
###     {
###       "id": 1,
###       "name": "demand_linear_v1.0",
